msgid ""
"Most of Krita's text output can be gathered using :guilabel:`Log Viewer`. The"
" only exception are messages from when Krita is starting up, so there is no"
" GUI yet, or when it closes or crashes so no user interaction is possible"
" after the event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/sharing_krita_logs.rst:244
